WEBVTT

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:08.840
Been a while, huh, Coco?

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:09.620
How have you been doing?

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.370
Oh? Your brother?

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:13.350
Your brother is so fine that he couldn't be any finer!

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:17.340
Just now he was chasing some gang called "The Toast" or something to give them a good scolding!

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.300
So you're getting into fights?

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.350
What happened to your Bigfoot?

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.430
...Giants?

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.690
Idiot! Don't mess around!

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.940
Baka suka... bakasuka, bakasuka!

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.960
Destroy!

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.070
Bakasuka,

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.490
Basuketou-sukashu?

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.670
This is not street basketball.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:52.070
Is something new being created?

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.400
Bakasuka!

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:56.940
Bakasuka, bakasuka, bakasuka!

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.410
Basquash!

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:01.590
Basquash?

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:02.510
Basquash?

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:03.560
Basquash!

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.330
Here we go!

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:09.160
Basquash!

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:16.610
Okay, retreat!

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:30.960
The birth of Basquash.

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:50.570
SAINT HAS COME

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:05.640
Basquash, Basquash, Basquash, Basquash,

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:07.350
Basquash!

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:12.070
And here it is, the moment of truth!

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:13.230
All together now...

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.660
Basquash!

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:24.510
Giants...

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:34.960
It's fine, fine, fine!

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:38.050
That right there is the sport we've been searching for!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.170
BFB?

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:40.990
That kiddie league crap is old news!

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:41.720
From now on it's...

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.240
Basquash!

00:02:45.730 --> 00:02:46.790
Oh, sorry.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:48.430
That's our ball, Mister.

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.080
{mmm sound} Natural leather.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.590
It's a nice one.

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:53.880
Thanks!

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:58.760
Whoa! Wow!

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.100
Awesome!

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.070
{mm} A good ball.

00:03:03.630 --> 00:03:06.540
Nice and spherical. Truly beautiful.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:07.290
All righty.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:08.660
Sold.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:12.560
What?

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:13.920
James Lone!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:14.880
Who?

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:18.960
Idiot! You don't know James Lone, the Hall of Famer?

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:35.100
Jeez. Try getting off your lazy butts!

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.860
Here's a job for you! A job!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:39.740
What kind?

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.660
The shipment is a small container, and they've requested a rush delivery.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.500
Boring job.

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:48.450
Beggars can't be choosers!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:52.070
Your heart isn't in it any more, is it? Not since that last match.

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:54.110
He's spineless! Dan the dunce!

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.780
I couldn't care less.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:03.110
You're the town's hero now! Way to be emo.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:08.390
Ever since then, everywhere I go there are nothing but cops.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:12.850
If he can't play Basquash, a hero's not worth crap.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:16.350
But I can crap anywhere I want. Wanna see?

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:19.610
Come on now. Quit lazing around and get to work.

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.650
What is it? Are you frustrated?

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:35.710
No, the opposite.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:41.070
If you get to do something that jumpstarts you alive like that,

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.880
the feeling comes rushing back every time you think about it...

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:50.230
I see. Overstimulated.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:51.040
Sela!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:52.730
A hot guy?!

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:01.200
Huh? Where'd Handsome go? Huh?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.450
You <i>must</i> be frustrated.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:14.030
So, the vehicles have right-of-way earthside?

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:15.780
What barbaric traffic laws.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.020
That person...

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:33.220
They're from the moon...

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.690
Dangan delivery for you...

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:31.740
You're Dunk Mask?

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.440
Yeah, so?

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:35.780
You're tiny.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:36.910
What?!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.360
You, go one-on-one with me.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.100
What the hell?

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.330
What are you trying to pull?

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.440
I'll pay you.

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:50.130
But that has nothing to do with the one-on-one.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:51.010
W-Wait a sec!

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:13.370
So this is the street style!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.650
It's as entertaining as I thought!

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.410
It would be a waste to let butterfingered amateurs have all the fun!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.390
Amateurs?!

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:19.220
Don't give me that crap!

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:21.250
You're talking to the person who invented the whole—

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.250
Shit!

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.070
Five minutes would be enough.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.430
If you could delay your mobilization by just a bit,

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:32.990
we could manage one game.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:35.120
But these matches, that's the thing...

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:37.010
There's all kinds of collateral damage,

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.890
so the citizens come to us lodging complaints.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.640
That's why we've strengthened the patrols...

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.040
It's a fact that by nature, the more you tell people not to do something,

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:44.740
the more they'll <i>want</i> to do it.

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:48.360
Let them blow off some steam this way...

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:51.280
...and Basquash rules would be guaranteed to go global.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.360
No, they might be already!

00:07:55.670 --> 00:08:00.830
Well, it might've been a stretch to think we could suddenly show up and petition for an illegal street match.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:01.780
Damn it!

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:03.240
If only they weren't so thickheaded!

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.380
I guess we'll have to do this the underhanded way.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.680
Underhanded?

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.930
Hi there, Mister Mayor.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:17.970
I'm gonna make sure you listen to me today.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:20.060
Underhanded, huh...

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:23.140
Mis-ter May-or.

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:26.800
This town's a mess.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.830
It overflows with the sort of crudeness that stems from ignorance...

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:32.400
...and the sort of ambition that springs from immaturity.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:36.660
But that in itself creates the possibility for something new to be born here.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:41.000
Long time no see, Haruka Gracia.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.950
James... Lone...

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.510
Huh?

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:52.890
I told you, all I did was defend myself when he picked a fight with me!

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:56.090
You ought to be aware that streetball is illegal!

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.520
It's that bastard bird-man's fault, not mine!

00:08:58.520 --> 00:08:59.600
Where is he?!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:00.680
Giving autographs.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:01.140
What?!

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:02.550
Thank you very much!

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.340
Can I be next?

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:05.380
Wait a second!

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:07.570
What's the deal? Why are they all flocking around him?!

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:10.120
Idiot! He's Falcon, the one-and-only!

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:15.150
The Black Eagles were BFB League champions last season, and he was their leading scorer...

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.090
That's him, Falcon Lightwing!

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:23.910
Who is this guy?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:27.520
James Lone, the "Man with the limbs of God."

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:32.290
A success story who was inducted into the Hall of Fame and got his own moon passport.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.970
A moon passport...

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:38.430
Long time no see, James.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:42.130
Aren't you a big shot in the Mooneyes Executive Council now?

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:46.830
President-for-life of the Sports and Culture Development Board, to be precise.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:50.770
So what business brings Mr. President-for-life earthside, I wonder?

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:01.110
Divine spheres, as always.

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:03.040
Two beautiful balls...

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:07.330
Chaste Bianca and determined Kate.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:12.540
Oh, so you still use those names for my breasts?

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:15.990
There's nothing more beautiful in this world than round balls.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:22.140
Just like these countless soap bubbles, your Bianca and Kate are gorgeous spheres, and I loved them.

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:24.650
I would never forget them.

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:28.750
Open-style Bigfoot basketball...

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:31.270
An outstanding sport that emerged from the streets.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:35.150
The Executive Council is very interested indeed.

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:43.280
Open City Basketball!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.950
This is the birth of a new sport!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.910
Greetings to all the freestylers...

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:51.580
playing on every street in the land, not the least here in Rollingtown.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:55.540
To give you a place where you can polish your skills to the fullest,

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:57.820
I've set up an official league.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.130
It's called "Open City Basketball"—

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.530
the OCB League.

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:06.370
We are hereby soliciting applications for players who wish to join the official teams.

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.980
Tryouts will begin immediately,

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:13.560
so all those with confidence in their skills are encouraged to apply.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.560
Is that what you want?

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.200
You should try out as well.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.480
Do so and the police will no longer be an obstacle.

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:25.590
If you wish to settle this, seek me there.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.010
Sounds good.

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:32.920
I'll be there, and I'll turn that place <i>inside-out</i>.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.100
You think you can?

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.230
What's the meaning of this?!

00:11:55.610 --> 00:12:01.600
Well, the association has designated Rollingtown the official home of Open City Basketball.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:06.830
From now on, any Bigfoot that engages in street play will be immediately seized and its operator arrested.

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:09.630
Matches are prohibited to everyone except the official players.

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:13.210
James...

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:27.610
Dribble like you're throwing the ball out in front of yourself.

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:29.630
When you grip the ball, imagine you're gripping its center.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:33.020
Gripping the center...

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.780
Playing with a Bigfoot won't make a difference.

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:37.290
Without developing a feel for basketball by playing in your own skin,

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.630
you won't pass the tryouts.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.530
Yes. You might be all right.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:49.740
Dan's statue has had a resurrection!

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:53.970
Up that high, I doubt Destroy will be able to have his way with it again.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.630
{heh sound}I didn't think you'd come for a reason like that.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.680
Men are so simple.

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:04.220
So what about you?

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.750
I'm even simpler.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.160
I want the genes of a strong man.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.700
Oh, he looks strong.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.570
He's mine, you got that?

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:14.990
What's gotten into you?

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:16.280
Without further delay,

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:20.520
We shall now begin the Open City Basketball OCB League Round 1 tryouts...

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.520
What do you think, Slash?

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.220
Your first time earthside in a long time.

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:24.060
Execrable.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:26.050
The air and gravity are heavy,

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:27.580
and the city is coated with dust.

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:33.610
Any news on the BFB League players that we contacted?

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:36.550
All the elite players are here.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:41.250
This will put the nail in the coffin for earthside Bigfoot Basketball.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.350
I'd been wanting to get rid of it.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:44.680
This works.

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:46.880
You're as callous as ever.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.760
Here before your eyes, the first tryouts on Earthdash.

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:54.660
Tryouts for players of Open City Basketball are about to begin!

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.310
Just get on with it...

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:57.160
What's wrong?

00:13:57.160 --> 00:14:01.900
All this time they've been saying "Open City Basketball," "Open City Basketball"...

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:05.030
What happened to calling it "Basquash"?

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:08.950
Well, this is the official league, so... that doesn't count.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:12.480
What? So that night never happened?

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:14.020
Go for it!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.160
Thirty-five points for No. 60.

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:23.000
These don't even make it to the left of the decimal point.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.950
Well, there's so many to get through.

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:26.650
Let's bounce them right on out.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:31.450
No. 68, Allan Naismith...

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:36.350
No. 68, qualified!

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:40.520
No. 77, qualified!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.340
All right, this is the last round.

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:46.020
The spotlight is on the Black Eagles' Falcon Lightwing,

00:14:46.020 --> 00:14:49.910
and the man known by those in the street world as Dunk Mask!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:53.300
Oh! Good, good, I've been waiting for this!

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:54.790
Come on, Dunk Mask!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.450
Basquash!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.210
Those two...

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:04.100
Yes. So he's Dunk Mask.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:06.250
This match looks interesting.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:10.000
What?!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.230
He's good!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.740
He has the speed.

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:25.110
But his movements are too direct. I can read what he's going to do.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:27.090
Fake right and go left,

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:29.030
fake left and then spin!

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:31.610
A feint I can read is no feint at all!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:33.870
Shit! What is this guy, a mind-reader?

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.170
He's good.

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:37.440
I knew that was a fine man!

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:39.660
He's showing the excellent technique he got from the Pros.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.310
Cutting inside?

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:42.120
I won't let you.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.230
I've cut you off. What will you do now?

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:46.520
That's it, jab right. And what next?

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:47.460
You've got no choice but to pivot.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.330
That's right, pivot and dodge.

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:51.240
But what'll you do now? Go straight?

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:52.270
Go high? Low?

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:53.800
Continue your pivot and then step back?

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:55.680
Shit!

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:00.100
Dunk Mask is dancing?

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.350
No... He's being made to dance!

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:05.680
This must be a pro's true skill...

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.820
Destroy!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:22.050
T-That's Iceman!

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:24.990
The Frozen Inferno, Iceman Hotty!

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:27.470
And his eyes say <i>danger</i>!

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:30.960
Today's Destroy is a Destroy pushed over the edge!

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:32.980
He intends to kill.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:35.890
Those eyes... they scream murder.

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:38.310
What will you do?

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.420
He's an intruder.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.440
Intriguing.

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:44.640
Now <i>this</i> is a good tryout.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:47.560
What the hell are you doing?!

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:50.960
Falcon.

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:54.180
Iceman.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:59.080
Is the basketball you were striving for no more than this in the end?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.800
Iceman, you shithead, stay out of this!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.290
Destroy!

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.590
That guy...

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:10.050
...is mine!

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:08.910
<i>{overlapping}Idiot! It'll kill you!</i>

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:24.730
Basquash!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:41.570
Shit!

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:44.920
Even in plain basketball, your stupid plays never change.

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:46.210
Shut up!

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:47.460
Good!

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:48.540
Qualified!

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:53.500
You and you qualify too,

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.770
but for <i>you</i> I'll leap straight to the contract.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:59.640
Welcome to my OCB!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.780
Huh? What?

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.850
Are you sure?

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:08.000
I'm sure.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:11.710
He's a bit rough, but with some polishing he'll be a jewel...

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.360
...so brilliant it will shine into the far reaches of space.

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:20.900
Congratulations, Dan.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.590
What's this?

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:24.130
Look at all the zeros!

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:25.980
Yeah right, you're kidding!

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.170
I don't need some silly doodle like this!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.750
Incredible! I knew he was incredible!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.680
Is that so?

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:39.090
I suppose you prefer shiny things.

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.980
Whoa! It's a mountain of sparkles!

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:59.700
Now, you have a debt of 5.3 billion, correct?

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:02.160
What are you getting at?

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:05.030
If I can sign all of you exemplary athletes,

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:07.830
Open City Basketball will take off like a rocket.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:11.410
Not only throughout all of Earthdash, but even moonside.

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.340
Even the moon?!

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:20.020
Yes. For earthside youth, the OCB is a direct path to getting your own moon passport.

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:22.130
Don't you want to go there, too?

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:25.510
Don't you want to heal your little sister's legs?

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:28.680
How do you know that?

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:34.580
The tryout's final round will be a simulated match in Bigfoots, and will take place in the streets!

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:37.190
In other words, the first outdoor match of the OCB!

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:42.660
The cards will be the remaining street warriors,

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.450
in a rivalry match versus the elite of the BFB!

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:50.290
This match will decide who goes on to be the players of my league!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:52.250
This is awesome!

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:55.430
Look forward to it, everyone!

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:09.750
I'm going to cut those ties you are unable to let go of.

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:12.490
Falcon.

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:16.980
For my future, and for my dreams,

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:20.090
I'll cut off the past completely.

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:34.110
You suck.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:45.380
I have to work hard and do my best in the rivalry match...

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:46.670
Do my best, and then I can...

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.640
I've found you, Princess!

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:54.460
Th-That can't be...

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:59.660
Come, Princess. Come, Princess Flora.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.580
Come with me...

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.840
...Princess!

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:08.910
N-No!

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:16.660
Still, I can't wait to see Dan playing in the OCB.

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:19.040
Before that there's still the simulated match on the streets.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.380
We have to establish the official rules...

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:26.200
NEXT TIME

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:23.900
Next time: Within, Out Of.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:26.200
WITHIN

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:26.200
OUT OF

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.310
Oh, what'll we do about lines?
